---
title: "Review Assessment Workflow"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Awaiting session start
  s1: Load first-step document
  s2: Step 1: Inspect annotations (read-only)
  s3: Document or access error
  s4: Load second-step document
  s5: Second-step document or access error
  s6: Step 2: Read review and save assessment
  s7: Confirm finish
  s8: Submitting session
  s9: Session finished
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Start [admitted writable session]
  s1 --> s2: Document loaded
  s1 --> s3: Document load fails
  s2 --> s4: Next
  s3 --> s1: Reload after resolving problem
  s4 --> s5: Document load fails
  s4 --> s6: Document loaded
  s5 --> s4: Reload after resolving problem
  s6 --> s2: Previous [allowBackward=true]
  s6 --> s7: Finish [assessment optional or all criteria saved]
  s7 --> s8: Confirm finish [study not closed]
  s8 --> s9: Server accepts finish#59; end timestamp set
  s8 --> s6: Server rejects finish#59; show error
